  "solution": {
    "text": "Work done $=\\frac{1}{2} \\frac{\\mathrm{q}^2}{\\mathrm{C}}=\\frac{\\left(8 \\times 10^{-18}\\right)^2}{2 \\times 100 \\times 10^{-6}}$<br />$=32 \\times 10^{-32} \\mathrm{~J}$"
